  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A super-shiny lip gloss that quickly hydrates and smooths for lasting comfort with a glass-like finish.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Gloss</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Sodium Hyaluronate: Hydrates.</p><p>- Pomegranate Extract: Locks in moisture.</p><p>- Jojoba Oil: Nourishes.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, and triclosan. It is also gluten-free and cruelty-free.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" >-Wear alone or over your favorite lipstick for a glassy, high-shine finish.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-Pro tip: Line your lips with Ultra Suede® Lip Liner (sold separately) for a more defined, fuller pout before applying SuperShine™ Lip Gloss.</span></p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Sodium Hyaluronate: Hydrates.<br>-Pomegranate Extract: Locks in moisture.<br>-Jojoba Oil: Nourishes.<br><br>Polybutene, Octyldodecanol, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Silica Silylate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Punica Granatum Flower Extract, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Tribehenin, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Trihydroxystearin, Lactic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Parfum (Fragrance), May Contain/Peut Contenir +/- : Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 6 (CI 15850), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140).</div></details>",
