0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" >-Wear alone or over your favorite lipstick for a glassy, high-shine finish.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-Pro tip: Line your lips with Ultra Suede® Lip Liner (sold separately) for a more defined, fuller pout before applying SuperShine™ Lip Gloss.</span></p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Sodium Hyaluronate: Hydrates.<br>-Pomegranate Extract: Locks in moisture.<br>-Jojoba Oil: Nourishes.<br><br>Polybutene, Octyldodecanol, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Silica Silylate, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Punica Granatum Flower Extract, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Tribehenin, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Trihydroxystearin, Lactic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Parfum (Fragrance), May Contain/Peut Contenir +/- : Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 6 (CI 15850), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140).</div></details>",
